sequenceDiagram
  actor Staff
  participant Web as Web form
  participant Server as Internal API
  participant Mock as External API

  Staff->>Web: Submit currency, amount, term, and risk band
  Web->>Web: Parse with the shared schema
  Web->>Server: POST /v1/quotes with x-correlation-id
  Server->>Server: Validate the body
  Server->>Mock: POST /v1/quotes with api-key and the same correlation id
  Mock->>Mock: Accept the key and price the band
  Mock-->>Server: 200 quote
  Server->>Server: Parse the response with the shared schema
  Server-->>Web: 200 quote and Content-Language
  Web-->>Staff: Show quote id, percent rate, and full-scale commission
